ner\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:af28bfa4-374f-44d3-a1de-5c3bd9c2872e\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span></li></ul>\n</div>   \n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>\n    <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Rivington_General\" title=\"Rivington General\">The Rivington General</a> <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;-2&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;-45</span></li></ul>\n</div>  <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Text\"> Text </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-book-text\">\n<p>[A note written in blood. The parchment is cheap, and smells faintly of iron and smoke.]\n</p><p><br>\n</p><p>How I soured and salted the smith for you, and yet you dared not devour him?\n</p><p><br>\n</p><p>I will not let his bittered meat spoil. Not when Bhaal could savour it.\n</p><p><br>\n</p><p>Orin\n</p>\n</div>    \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714203210\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.054 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.056 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1613/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 26970/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 5992/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 29/200\nExpensive parser function count: 2/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.011/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 936260/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   44.503      1 Template:MiscItemPage\n100.00%   44.503      1 -total\n 54.35%   24.187      7 Template:Icon_text\n 48.38%   21.531     17 Template:Trim\n 21.45%    9.547      2 Template:Uid\n 15.33%    6.822      1 Template:Main_only\n 13.54%    6.024      2 Template:Icon_link\n 12.41%    5.523      